    "pageContent": "<p class=\"md-bullet\">• **What to read before Batman R.I.P.?**</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Batman #65, 86, 112, 113, 134, 156 And 162, Detective Comics #215, 235, 247 And 267, And World’s Finest Comics #89.</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Batman #655-658, #663-669 and #672-675.</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• 序幕：Detective Comics #846-850.(<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/zhentanmanhua/11995/63435\">#847</a> , <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/zhentanmanhua/11995/63438\">#850</a>有出场)</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• **Batman RIP**</p>\n\n<p>    <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/details/53729\">DC宇宙0</a></p>\n\n<p>    <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/bianfuxiadc/13128/33921\">蝙蝠侠 #676-678</a>(<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/bianfuxiadc/13128/33921\">#676</a> ,  <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/bianfuxiadc/13128/40866\">#678</a>)</p>\n\n<p>    <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/luobin/14649/58362\">罗宾V4 #175-176</a></p>\n\n<p>    <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/bianfuxiadc/13128/54434\">蝙蝠侠 #679-681</a>(<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/bianfuxiadc/13128/54434\">#679</a>，<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/bianfuxiadc/13128/57133\">#681</a>)</p>\n\n<p>    蝙蝠侠与局外人#11-13</p>\n\n<p>    <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/dcyeyi/14977/120843\">夜翼V2 #147-150</a></p>\n\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• **Final Crisis**</p>\n\n<p>    （无出场，但*→一旦Batman RIP/Final Crisis/Last Rites的故事结束，蝙蝠侠就不复存在，必须选择新的蝙蝠侠。这发生在Batman: Battle for the Cowl跨界剧情中。*）</p>\n\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/zuizhongweiji/12675/25155\">Final Crisis #1-3</a></p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Superman Beyond #1-2</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Final Crisis: Submit</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Final Crisis #4-5</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Batman <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/bianfuxiadc/13128/57666\">#682-683</a></p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Final Crisis #6-7</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• **R.I.P. – The Missing Chapter**</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Batman #701–702</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• **Last Rites**</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Detective Comics #851</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Batman #684</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Detective Comics #852 (“Heart of Hush” epilogue)</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Batman #685 (“Heart of Hush” epilogue)</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Nightwing (vol. 2) <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/dcyeyi/14977/126607\">#151</a>-<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://manhua.zaimanhua.com/view/dcyeyi/14977/132630\">153</a> (Nightwing “R.I.P.” storyline epilogue)</p>\n<p class=\"md-bullet\">• Robin (vol. 4) #183 (the conclusion of Robin (vol. 4))</p>",
